  "motivation": [
    {"title":"You do not have to solve the whole future this semester.","body":"You need one honest next step: a concept you can explain, a problem you can solve without a hint, a model you can check or a course plan you have verified. Capability becomes visible in those small pieces."},
    {"title":"The ordinary work is part of the extraordinary work.","body":"A coordinate convention helps a robot move correctly. A unit check keeps an interface understandable. A clear plot helps a teammate see what the test actually showed. Fundamentals earn their importance through use."},
    {"title":"Let ambition improve the quality of today's evidence.","body":"A future habitat can be inspiring without making an algebra exercise feel beneath you. The useful question is: what does this exercise let me understand that I could not understand yesterday?"},
    {"title":"A difficult week is information.","body":"Identify the bottleneck: missing prerequisite, insufficient practice, overloaded schedule or unclear feedback. Change the method or the load early. Progress over years leaves room for recovery."},
    {"title":"You can contribute without being the person in the spacecraft.","body":"A reliable joint, a well-tested controller, a maintainable thermal system or a clear interface can enable work far beyond the place where it was designed."}
  ],
